.TH QUIPU-GIT-MERGETOOL 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-git\-mergetool \- Interactively resolve a pendant or declared DataBook using the standard merge layout
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu git\-mergetool\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-by\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIpendant\-export.nt\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Interactively resolve a pendant or declared DataBook using the standard merge layout
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-by\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Identity recording a resolution
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIpendant\-export.nt\fR>

